iresult.com.cm/uksssc-asst-inspector-ado-answer-key-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>16 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>16 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>16 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date : <strong>17-21 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date<strong> : 16 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>10 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>19 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>UKSSSC</b>\u00a0official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">For<strong> General/ OBC </strong>: <strong>\u20b9 300/-